# Deployed build config for the agent-console (internal-zone App/Runner host).
#
# Endpoint discovery is a BUILD-TIME read of import.meta.env.VITE_CONSOLE_URL (see
# src/api.ts) — there is no runtime endpoint resource. The P7-9 deploy step sets this
# to the resolved deployed console_server origin, then runs `pnpm --filter
# agent-console build` so the value is baked into the bundle, and `gsutil rsync dist/
# gs://<console_bucket_name>` uploads the assets.
#
# The console is an INTERNAL-zone surface: its bucket is provisioned PRIVATE and live
# internal serving (IAP / internal LB) is a follow-up (design/zones.md). This is an
# EXAMPLE, committed for documentation. Do NOT commit a real .env.production (Vite
# auto-loads it and would bake this placeholder value).
VITE_CONSOLE_URL=https://<deployed-console-host>
